# Play test of Basalt Cay (CIPlay basalt_cay, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: up the ladders to the lookout, its
# chest, the treasure. Points as in its recipe.
island Basalt Cay
offset 0 0
wait 3
at 2 -9 h=2
climb 2 -7.15 h=2
expect stand 2 -5 h=4.2 below=5
climb 2 -3.65 h=4.2
expect stand 2 -1.5 h=9 below=10
open Chest on the lookout
dig
